APPLICATION FOR DISCHARGE OF SURETY

That the applicant, [Name of Surety], being a surety for the bail bond of the accused, [Name of Accused], executed under Section 499 CrPC 1898, hereby applies for discharge from the said bond;

That the applicant seeks an order directing the discharge of the surety and release from all liabilities attached to the bond, pursuant to Section 502 CrPC 1898;

That the applicant has complied with all conditions of the bond and there is no pending matter that would prejudice the discharge; 

That the applicant respectfully requests that this Hon’ble Court issue a warrant of arrest, if necessary, and pass an order discharging the surety in accordance with Section 502 CrPC 1898.

